  "content": "<p><em><strong>本模组并非由我开发，所有功劳应归于来自日本 Minecraft 论坛的 Ryokusitai。</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.minecraftuser.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ff%253d13%2526t%253d6672%2526start%253d500%2523p127945\" rel=\"nofollow\">EEAA (EE 2 Addon Advanced Alchemy)</a>，它是 AK 为 Minecraft <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.minecraftuser.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ff%253d13%2526t%253d6672%2526start%253d500%2523p127945\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.2.5</a> 开发的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.minecraftuser.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ff%253d13%2526t%253d6672%2526start%253d500%2523p127945\" rel=\"nofollow\">EE 2</a> 的扩展模组，并对应 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.minecraftuser.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ff%253d13%2526t%253d6672%2526start%253d500%2523p127945\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project E 1.7.10</a> 的环境。尽管在 AK 恢复开发之前仍存在限制条件，但已获得 AK 的官方许可。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是从 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.minecraftuser.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ft%253d24695\" rel=\"nofollow\">PEEA 原始主题帖</a> 上传的内容，希望能让更多用户享受到其卓越的功能和强大的潜力。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>对于 Minecraft 1.12.2，请使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-ex\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProjectEX</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
